WEBVTT

00:00.961 --> 00:03.892
<i>[whimsical music]</i>
<i>[异想天开的音乐]</i>

00:03.961 --> 00:10.168
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

00:10.237 --> 00:12.755
[strange gurgling]
[奇怪的咕噜声]

00:12.823 --> 00:15.410
[creature groaning, growling]
[生物呻吟，咆哮]

00:15.479 --> 00:17.996
[hollering]
[喊叫]

00:18.065 --> 00:20.892
Be quiet down there
or I'm calling the cops!
下面保持安静
不然我就报警了！

00:20.961 --> 00:23.444
[both grunt]
both: What?
[两人咕哝]
两人：什么？

00:23.513 --> 00:27.686
[sighs]
I said, be quiet
[叹气]
我说，安静点

00:27.755 --> 00:31.168
or I'm calling the... [babbling]
或者我打电话给...[胡言乱语]

00:31.237 --> 00:33.272
[screaming]
[尖叫]

00:33.341 --> 00:35.306
[loud crash]
[巨响]

00:35.375 --> 00:38.099
[groaning]
[呻吟]

00:38.168 --> 00:41.168
Oh, my house.
哦，我的房子。

00:41.237 --> 00:43.892
My shelter!
My life!
我的庇护所！
我的生活！

00:43.961 --> 00:46.272
both: My, my, my.
两者：我的，我的，我的。

00:46.341 --> 00:47.548
[grunts]
[both exclaim]
[咕哝]
[两人惊呼]

00:47.617 --> 00:49.617
So, who you gonna stay with
那么，你要和谁呆在一起

00:49.686 --> 00:51.134
till you find
a new house, Squidward?
直到你找到
新房子，章鱼哥？

00:51.203 --> 00:52.858
Me or Patrick?
我还是帕特里克？

00:52.927 --> 00:55.892
I wouldn't stay
with either of you two idiots
我不会留下来
和你们两个白痴中的任何一个

00:55.961 --> 00:59.030
if the entire ocean was on fire
如果整个海洋都着火了

00:59.099 --> 01:01.720
and you were the only ones
with water.
而你是唯一的人
用水。

01:01.789 --> 01:03.410
- So there's a chance!
- Huh?
- 所以还有机会！
- 啊？

01:03.479 --> 01:06.375
[growls]
[angry muttering]
[咆哮]
[愤怒的嘀咕]

01:06.444 --> 01:08.306
<i>[dramatic music]</i>
<i>[戏剧音乐]</i>

01:08.375 --> 01:10.099
[grunts]
[咕哝]

01:10.168 --> 01:13.272
[goofy babbling]
[胡言乱语]

01:13.341 --> 01:14.513
<i>[lonesome western music]</i>
<i>[孤独的西方音乐]</i>

01:14.582 --> 01:17.203
[water swishing]
[水哗哗]

01:17.272 --> 01:20.375
[sighs]
Roughing it ain't so rough.
[叹气]
粗暴一点也没那么粗暴。

01:20.444 --> 01:22.203
[grunts]
[咕哝]

01:22.272 --> 01:24.755
<i>[ominous music]</i>
<i>[不祥的音乐]</i>

01:24.823 --> 01:26.099
[thunder crashing]
[雷霆轰鸣]

01:26.168 --> 01:27.444
Huh?
啊？

01:27.513 --> 01:30.306
Too rough!
[sighs]
太粗暴了！
[叹气]

01:30.375 --> 01:34.410
Oh, I guess it's Patrick.
哦，我猜是帕特里克。

01:34.479 --> 01:37.444
[goofy grunting]
[愚蠢的咕哝]

01:37.513 --> 01:39.548
<i>[lighthearted music]</i>
<i>[轻松的音乐]</i>

01:39.617 --> 01:41.617
- [grunts]
- [hollers]
- [咕哝]
- [喊叫]

01:41.686 --> 01:43.858
[grunts]
Identify myself!
[咕哝]
表明我自己的身份！

01:43.927 --> 01:47.686
[grunts]
Patrick?
[咕哝]
帕特里克？

01:47.755 --> 01:50.927
That is correct.
May I ask who's calling?
这是正确的。
请问你哪位？

01:50.996 --> 01:53.341
Oh, hi, Squidward!
- [grunts]
哦，嗨，章鱼哥！
- [咕哝]

01:53.410 --> 01:54.686
[babbles]
[胡言乱语]

01:54.755 --> 01:57.375
So, um, I've decided
to take you up
所以，嗯，我决定了
带你上去

01:57.444 --> 01:59.892
on your generous invitation.
应您的慷慨邀请。

01:59.961 --> 02:02.203
What about
my generator's vitamin?
怎么样
我的发电机的维生素？

02:02.272 --> 02:03.341
Oh, good grief.
哦，真可惜。

02:03.410 --> 02:05.410
I'm staying with you, you moron!
我会留在你身边，你这个白痴！

02:05.479 --> 02:08.410
Um, that is, if you'll have me.
嗯，就是说，如果你愿意的话。

02:08.479 --> 02:10.375
Oh, boy!
哦，孩子！

02:10.444 --> 02:14.961
Squidward's staying over!
Squidward's staying over!
章鱼哥留下来了！
章鱼哥留下来了！

02:15.030 --> 02:17.065
Sibley shining smine-mine!
- [grunting]
西布莉闪耀着我的光芒！
- [咕哝]

02:17.134 --> 02:18.892
[laughing, babbling]
- [grunting]
[大笑，胡言乱语]
- [咕哝]

02:18.961 --> 02:22.686
- Leedle-leedle-leedle-leedle!
- [sighs]
- 利德尔-利德尔-利德尔-利德尔！
- [叹气]

02:22.755 --> 02:26.134
You can take my bed,
Squiddy, old buddy.
你可以占用我的床
鱿鱼，老伙计。

02:26.203 --> 02:30.617
Well, um, maybe it won't be
so bad staying here after all.
嗯，嗯，也许不会
毕竟住在这里真是太糟糕了。

02:30.686 --> 02:34.823
Sleep tight,
don't let the sand mites bite.
睡个好觉，
不要让沙螨叮咬。

02:34.892 --> 02:38.375
But if they do, just let me
know and I'll smash 'em!
但如果他们这样做了，就让我
知道了我就会粉碎他们！

02:38.444 --> 02:40.237
[sighs]
Um...
[叹气]
嗯...

02:40.306 --> 02:42.375
[sniffs]
Huh.
[嗅嗅]
呵呵。

02:42.444 --> 02:44.858
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

02:44.927 --> 02:47.203
[slurps]
[啜饮]

02:47.272 --> 02:49.617
Uh-huh.
[sighs]
嗯嗯。
[叹气]

02:49.686 --> 02:52.237
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

02:52.306 --> 02:55.203
Hmm.
[snoring]
唔。
[打鼾]

02:55.272 --> 02:57.375
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

02:57.444 --> 02:58.789
[stammers]
What?
[结巴]
什么？

02:58.858 --> 03:01.444
Oh, a leaky rock?
噢，一块漏水的石头？

03:01.513 --> 03:04.513
[snoring]
[打鼾]

03:04.582 --> 03:06.099
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

03:06.168 --> 03:07.444
[air whistling]
[空气呼啸]

03:07.513 --> 03:10.927
Oh, you titanic twit,
get down from there!
哦，你这个泰坦尼克号笨蛋，
从那里下来！

03:10.996 --> 03:13.203
[gasps] I'll smash them
for you, Squidward!
[喘气]我会粉碎他们
为了你，章鱼哥！

03:13.272 --> 03:15.996
[hollers]
[喊叫]

03:16.065 --> 03:18.479
Squidward?
Where are you?
章鱼哥？
你在哪里？

03:18.548 --> 03:21.030
In your navel.
在你的肚脐里。

03:21.099 --> 03:23.134
- [grunting]
- [gasps]
- [咕哝]
- [喘气]

03:23.203 --> 03:26.823
[laughs]
That tickles.
[笑]
那很痒。

03:26.892 --> 03:28.823
[rooster crows]
[公鸡打鸣]

03:28.892 --> 03:31.513
[grunts, yawns]
[咕噜声，哈欠]

03:31.582 --> 03:34.341
Hmm?
What is this place?
唔？
这是什么地方？

03:34.410 --> 03:35.961
[exclaims, sniffs]
[惊呼，嗅嗅]

03:36.030 --> 03:37.444
[gasps]
Huh?
[喘气]
啊？

03:37.513 --> 03:39.444
[sniffing, babbling]
[嗅嗅，胡言乱语]

03:39.513 --> 03:42.065
Squidward, did you do all this?
章鱼哥，这一切都是你做的吗？

03:42.134 --> 03:44.030
Well, I figured
if I have to stay here,
嗯，我想
如果我必须留在这里

03:44.099 --> 03:46.237
I might as well make it livable.
我不妨让它变得宜居。

03:46.306 --> 03:48.065
Lard cake?
猪油蛋糕？

03:48.134 --> 03:51.582
If you make me lard cakes
every morning, Squiddy,
如果你给我做猪油蛋糕
每天早上，鱿鱼，

03:51.651 --> 03:55.341
you can do anything you want.
你可以做任何你想做的事。

03:55.410 --> 03:57.168
[groans]
- Ah-ah-ah-ah.
[呻吟]
- 啊啊啊啊。

03:57.237 --> 04:01.306
The etiquette spoon says,
"Eat like a gentleman."
礼仪勺说，
“吃得像个绅士。”

04:01.375 --> 04:05.168
Ah, a gentleman.
啊，一位绅士。

04:05.237 --> 04:07.617
[grunts, sighs]
[咕哝，叹气]

04:07.686 --> 04:09.789
Watch me, idiot.
看着我，白痴。

04:09.858 --> 04:12.858
A gentleman eats like this.
君子就是这样吃的。

04:12.927 --> 04:15.341
[goofy exclamations]
[愚蠢的感叹]

04:15.410 --> 04:17.237
[goofy exclamations]
[愚蠢的感叹]

04:17.306 --> 04:21.203
Holy halibut,
can he actually be taught?
圣大比目鱼，
他真的可以被教导吗？

04:21.272 --> 04:22.720
I can mold him.
我可以塑造他。

04:22.789 --> 04:25.444
I can squeeze this lump of clay
我可以挤压这块粘土

04:25.513 --> 04:27.892
into a cultured sophisticate.
变成有文化的世故。

04:27.961 --> 04:31.720
I will make you
the most tolerable roommate
我会让你
最能容忍的室友

04:31.789 --> 04:33.548
of all time!
有史以来！

04:33.617 --> 04:37.617
You'll be my
"roommate-sterpiece!"
你将是我的
“室友的杰作！”

04:37.686 --> 04:41.789
Oh, more lard cakes, please!
哦，请再来一份猪油蛋糕！

04:41.858 --> 04:43.720
[humming]
[嗡嗡声]

04:43.789 --> 04:45.134
[grunts]
[咕哝]

04:45.203 --> 04:48.651
- [grunts]
- [exclaims]
- [咕哝]
- [惊呼]

04:48.720 --> 04:51.168
[chuckles]
[笑声]

04:51.237 --> 04:52.410
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

04:52.479 --> 04:53.927
- [sighs]
- Huh?
- [叹气]
- 啊？

04:53.996 --> 04:56.065
- Oh!
- [grunts]
- 哦！
- [咕哝]

04:56.134 --> 05:00.168
[laughs]
- [exclaims]
[笑]
- [惊呼]

05:00.237 --> 05:03.065
[playing scales]
[演奏音阶]

05:03.134 --> 05:05.927
[gasps]
[playing discordant scales]
[喘气]
[演奏不和谐音阶]

05:05.996 --> 05:08.099
[playing mellow tune]
[演奏柔和的曲子]

05:08.168 --> 05:09.789
[gasps]
[喘气]

05:09.858 --> 05:10.927
[plays discordant note]
[演奏不和谐的音符]

05:10.996 --> 05:13.686
Oh![grunts]
哦！[咕哝]

05:13.755 --> 05:16.686
<i>[lighthearted music]</i>
<i>[轻松的音乐]</i>

05:16.755 --> 05:18.306
Hmm.
唔。

05:18.375 --> 05:20.720
[gasps]
Aha!
[喘气]
啊哈！

05:20.789 --> 05:22.996
[grunts]
[咕哝]

05:23.065 --> 05:24.892
[blows kiss, sighs]
[飞吻，叹息]

05:24.961 --> 05:26.858
- [blows kiss]
- [chuckles]
- [飞吻]
- [轻笑]

05:26.927 --> 05:30.720
[both giggling]
[两人都咯咯笑]

05:30.789 --> 05:32.410
<i>[dramatic music]</i>
<i>[戏剧音乐]</i>

05:32.479 --> 05:34.789
[all chattering]
[大家都在喋喋不休]

05:34.858 --> 05:36.410
[both playing rousing tune]
[两人都演奏着振奋人心的曲子]

05:36.479 --> 05:37.651
Culture lovers,
文化爱好者，

05:37.720 --> 05:42.099
welcome to the Classy Kiosk!
欢迎来到优雅的信息亭！

05:42.168 --> 05:44.375
I am Squid-tacular,
我是乌贼，

05:44.444 --> 05:48.306
and this is my protégé,
Patrick Panache.
这是我的门徒，
帕特里克·帕纳奇.

05:48.375 --> 05:50.444
He taught me everything I blow!
我吹的一切都是他教的！

05:50.513 --> 05:52.755
[plays discordant note]
[演奏不和谐的音符]

05:52.823 --> 05:55.686
And now, get ready to...
现在，准备好...

05:55.755 --> 05:58.341
both: Feel the art!
两者：感受艺术！

05:58.410 --> 06:00.168
[both grunt]
[两人咕哝]

06:00.237 --> 06:02.789
[sighs]
[grunting]
[叹气]
[咕噜声]

06:02.858 --> 06:05.686
Yes...
[muttering inaudibly]
是的...
[小声嘀咕]

06:05.755 --> 06:07.582
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

06:07.651 --> 06:09.513
[crowd booing]
[人群嘘声]

06:09.582 --> 06:11.755
[babbling]
[all gasp]
[胡言乱语]
[全都喘气]

06:11.823 --> 06:14.720
[all chattering, cheering]
[大家叽叽喳喳，欢呼雀跃]

06:14.789 --> 06:16.651
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

06:16.720 --> 06:18.030
What?
什么？

06:18.099 --> 06:19.755
Hey, watch me, everyone!
嘿嘿，大家看着我！

06:19.823 --> 06:22.548
I will now bedazzle
your dazzlers
我现在会眼花缭乱
你的眼花缭乱

06:22.617 --> 06:26.444
with interpretative dance!
与诠释舞蹈！

06:26.513 --> 06:29.479
[babbling]
[胡说]

06:29.548 --> 06:32.341
[crowd grumbling]
[人群抱怨声]

06:32.410 --> 06:35.479
<i>[lighthearted jazzy music]</i>
<i>[轻松的爵士音乐]</i>

06:35.548 --> 06:36.823
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

06:36.892 --> 06:39.892
[grunts]
- My turn!
[咕哝]
- 轮到我了！

06:39.961 --> 06:42.961
[babbling]
[胡说]

06:43.030 --> 06:45.099
<i>[lively orchestral music]</i>
<i>[活泼的管弦乐]</i>

06:45.168 --> 06:46.892
[all gasp, cheering]
[全场喘气，欢呼]

06:46.961 --> 06:48.444
What the...
什么...

06:48.513 --> 06:50.720
Who knew that Patrick
could dance like an angel?
谁知道帕特里克
可以像天使一样跳舞吗？

06:50.789 --> 06:53.755
[laughs]
Bravo, bravo!
[笑]
太棒了，太棒了！

06:53.823 --> 06:55.203
Oh, Mr. Krabs,
you dropped this.
哦，蟹老板，
你把这个掉了。

06:55.272 --> 06:57.892
Oop, thanks.[laughs]
噢，谢谢。[笑]

06:57.961 --> 07:00.789
Patrick Panache!
Patrick Panache!
帕特里克·帕纳奇！
帕特里克·帕纳奇！

07:00.858 --> 07:03.651
You make a better Squidward
than Squidward does.
你会成为更好的章鱼哥
比章鱼哥还多。

07:03.720 --> 07:05.444
[laughs]
[笑]

07:05.513 --> 07:06.996
[imitating Squidward]
I do?
【模仿章鱼哥】
我愿意吗？

07:07.065 --> 07:09.686
- Huh?
- [laughs]
- 啊？
- [笑]

07:09.755 --> 07:12.858
[sighs]
[laughter]
[叹气]
[笑声]

07:12.927 --> 07:14.375
Hey, stop making those noises!
嘿，别再发出那些声音了！

07:14.444 --> 07:17.755
Those are my noises![sighs]
这些是我的声音！[叹气]

07:17.823 --> 07:19.858
- [sighs]
- Huh?
- [叹气]
- 啊？

07:19.927 --> 07:21.651
- [laughs]
- [growls]
- [笑]
- [咆哮]

07:21.720 --> 07:23.168
- [laughs]
- [growls]
- [笑]
- [咆哮]

07:23.237 --> 07:24.651
- [laughs]
- Hey-hey!
- [笑]
- 嘿嘿！

07:24.720 --> 07:28.099
Patrick is the best Squidward!
all: Huzzah!
帕特里克是最好的章鱼哥！
全体：万岁！

07:28.168 --> 07:30.755
[all cheering]
[大家欢呼]

07:30.823 --> 07:32.720
So, Squidward, what do you think
那么，章鱼哥，你觉得怎么样？

07:32.789 --> 07:34.686
of your new protégé, huh?
你的新门生，是吧？

07:34.755 --> 07:38.720
New protégé...
[growling]
新门生...
[咆哮]

07:38.789 --> 07:40.927
He stinks!
他很臭！

07:40.996 --> 07:43.030
And he's not a better me!
而他也不是更好的我！

07:43.099 --> 07:45.582
He's an imposter.
- Hmm.
他是个冒名顶替者。
- 唔。

07:45.651 --> 07:48.168
Well, if Patrick makes
a better Squidward,
好吧，如果帕特里克让
更好的章鱼哥，

07:48.237 --> 07:49.996
maybe you'd make
a better Patrick.
也许你会做
一个更好的帕特里克。

07:50.065 --> 07:51.375
[laughs]
- [scoffs]
[笑]
- [嘲笑]

07:51.444 --> 07:54.375
Yeah, right, "I would make
a better Patrick."
是的，没错，“我会让
一个更好的帕特里克。”

07:54.444 --> 07:57.513
[stammers]
Wait a minute, that's it!
[结巴]
等一下，就是这样！

07:57.582 --> 08:01.134
That'll teach him.
Oh, thanks, SpongeBob.
那会教他的。
哦，谢谢，海绵宝宝。

08:01.203 --> 08:02.892
- Mm.
- [smooches]
- 毫米。
- [亲吻]

08:02.961 --> 08:05.134
Oh, wait a minute, Squidward,
you dropped your chee...
噢，等一下，章鱼哥，
你掉了你的奶酪...

08:05.203 --> 08:08.203
[sniffs, gags]
[groans]
[嗅嗅，堵嘴]
[呻吟]

08:10.030 --> 08:12.686
[groans, sighs]
[呻吟，叹息]

08:12.755 --> 08:16.961
Well, Patrick,
time for another lovely day
好吧，帕特里克，
又是美好一天的时间

08:17.030 --> 08:20.168
in the flower garden of life.
在生命的花园里。

08:20.237 --> 08:23.686
[sighs]
- [babbling]
[叹气]
- [胡言乱语]

08:23.755 --> 08:25.927
I love you, brick.[grunts]
我爱你，砖头。[咕哝]

08:25.996 --> 08:28.306
I love you, brick.
[grunts]
我爱你，砖头。
[咕哝]

08:28.375 --> 08:30.996
I love you, brick.[grunts]
我爱你，砖头。[咕哝]

08:31.065 --> 08:32.961
Squidward, you kelp head,
章鱼哥，你这个海藻头，

08:33.030 --> 08:35.341
what did you do
to my beautiful house?
你做了什么
去我美丽的房子吗？

08:35.410 --> 08:37.858
Define "do."
定义“做”。

08:37.927 --> 08:39.168
[grunts]
- [hollers]
[咕哝]
- [喊叫]

08:39.237 --> 08:42.444
Don't put my art up your nose,
you cretin!
别把我的艺术放在你的鼻子底下
你这个白痴！

08:42.513 --> 08:44.927
[babbles]
[胡言乱语]

08:44.996 --> 08:47.823
[gulps]
I might need that someday.
[吞咽]
有一天我可能需要它。

08:47.892 --> 08:50.961
Duh...
- [sighs]
呃……
- [叹气]

08:51.030 --> 08:53.168
I'll play
the old licorice stick.
我会玩
老甘草棒

08:53.237 --> 08:55.858
That always soothes my nerves.
这总是能舒缓我的神经。

08:55.927 --> 08:58.996
[yelps]
- [munching]
[尖叫声]
- [咀嚼]

08:59.065 --> 09:02.065
Doesn't taste like licorice.
味道不像甘草。

09:02.134 --> 09:03.858
My clarinet!
我的单簧管！

09:03.927 --> 09:05.617
No!
不！

09:05.686 --> 09:08.823
[spits]
Oh, sorry, you want some?
[吐口水]
哦，抱歉，你想要一些吗？

09:08.892 --> 09:10.789
Ah-ah-ah!
啊啊啊！

09:10.858 --> 09:13.065
The etiquette spoon came back
礼仪勺回来了

09:13.134 --> 09:16.272
and he says,
"Eat like a gentlemen."
他说，
“像绅士一样吃饭。”

09:16.341 --> 09:19.927
- [goofy babbling]
- [laughing]
- [愚蠢的胡言乱语]
- [笑]

09:19.996 --> 09:23.996
Um... um, I'm going to go play
嗯……嗯，我去玩了

09:24.065 --> 09:26.720
with my best friend SpongeBob.
和我最好的朋友海绵宝宝。

09:26.789 --> 09:28.789
[laughing]
[笑]

09:28.858 --> 09:31.272
Yeah, you do that
是的，你这样做

09:31.341 --> 09:34.065
while I take a Pat nap.
当我小睡时。

09:34.134 --> 09:35.996
[sighs]
[叹气]

09:36.065 --> 09:37.720
[grunts]
[both laughing]
[咕哝]
[两人都笑了]

09:37.789 --> 09:42.134
[grunts] What are those ninnies
up to now?
[咕噜声]那些傻瓜是什么？
到现在为止？

09:42.203 --> 09:43.444
[laughs] I told you
[笑]我告诉过你了

09:43.513 --> 09:45.651
you'd make a
great Patrick, Squidward!
你会做一个
伟大的帕特里克、章鱼哥！

09:45.720 --> 09:47.651
[laughing]
[笑]

09:47.720 --> 09:49.823
Pipe down, you two!
你们两个，冷静下来！

09:49.892 --> 09:52.203
Hey, Patrick, heads up!
嘿，帕特里克，抬头！

09:52.272 --> 09:53.444
[grunts]
- Ooh!
[咕哝]
- 哦！

09:53.513 --> 09:56.168
both: Bull's-eye!
[both laughing]
双方：靶心！
[两人都笑了]

09:56.237 --> 09:59.996
I said be quiet, you two,
or I'm calling the...
我说你们两个安静一点
或者我打电话给...

10:00.065 --> 10:03.375
[gulps]
Mud.
[吞咽]
泥。

10:03.444 --> 10:05.479
Puddle!
水坑！

10:05.548 --> 10:07.789
[grunts, babbles]
[咕哝声，胡言乱语]

10:07.858 --> 10:11.065
[gasps, sighs]
[喘气，叹气]

10:11.134 --> 10:13.479
[laughs]
Hey!
[笑]
嘿！

10:13.548 --> 10:15.582
[grunts]
[咕哝]

10:15.651 --> 10:19.513
[spits]
He's Patrick again!
[吐口水]
他又是帕特里克了！

10:19.582 --> 10:21.099
Finally!
最后！

10:21.168 --> 10:24.720
both: Squidward, look!
两人：章鱼哥，看！

10:24.789 --> 10:27.168
[goofy babbling]
[胡言乱语]

10:27.237 --> 10:28.961
It's the new house I ordered!
这就是我订的新房！

10:29.030 --> 10:31.030
No more Patrick!
不再有帕特里克了！

10:31.099 --> 10:33.548
<i>[upbeat music]</i>
<i>[欢快的音乐]</i>

10:33.617 --> 10:34.961
all: Yay!
全体：耶！

10:35.030 --> 10:36.892
[clattering]
[咔哒声]

10:36.961 --> 10:40.065
[all groan, grunt]
[所有呻吟声、咕噜声]

10:40.134 --> 10:41.686
both: Huh?
两人：啊？

10:41.755 --> 10:44.168
[groans]
[呻吟]

10:44.237 --> 10:48.065
both: Whoo!
- [laughs]
两人：哇！
- [笑]

10:48.134 --> 10:50.444
- Good-night, SpongeBob.
- Night, Patrick.
- 晚安，海绵宝宝。
- 晚安，帕特里克。

10:50.513 --> 10:52.823
both: Good-night, Squidward.
两人：晚安，章鱼哥。

10:52.892 --> 10:54.548
[both smooch]
[双方接吻]

10:54.617 --> 10:56.582
[sobbing]
[抽泣]

[抽泣]